Akanechi!

76
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:42,000
Nekama means...

77
00:04:42,000 --> 00:04:46,000
A guy portraying as a woman online where his true appearance and identity remain unknown.

78
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:51,000
The person representing himself as a woman, or in other cases, it can refer to the act of doing so.

79
00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:58,000
It's an abbreviation of the term Net-Okama, which has been used since even the pre-Internet days of online communications.

80
00:04:58,000 --> 00:04:59,000
Ne... Ka...

81
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:01,000
No, no, no. You're wrong.

82
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:06,000
I am a gear that moves my muse, who descended upon the cyberspace sea.

83
00:05:06,000 --> 00:05:10,000
In other words, Rurihime and I are one and the same, while also being totally different.

84
00:05:10,000 --> 00:05:15,000
Low them I to describe this unique state of existence with a cheap term as loaded as Nekama.

85
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:17,000
Or rather I should say it's not so facile as that.

86
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:21,000
In the 2D world, Rurihime and I are, if anything, bound by a common destiny.

87
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:26,000
