99
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:56,000
Um, uh, hello, I'm Takezo Kamota.

100
00:05:56,000 --> 00:06:00,000
My in-game character name is Takezo as well and is spelled out in English.

101
00:06:00,000 --> 00:06:05,000
