160
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:30,000
My sister is super territorial and she's in the throes of adolescent rebellion, so she can be a bit abrasive.

161
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:34,000
Really now, Rona? It's so rude to talk to an older girl like that.

162
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,000
No.

163
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:36,000
