187
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:13,000
Oh, what are you having? I'll order for you.

188
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:15,000
Please, order first.

189
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:23,000
Thank goodness.

190
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:25,000
Are you alright?

191
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:27,000
I'm fine.

192
00:10:27,000 --> 00:10:30,000
Sorry, I think I feel the call of nature.

193
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:32,000
So he's Ruhihime.

194
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:34,000
And she's still glaring.

195
