200
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:47,000
Aw, thanks for your concern.

201
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:49,000
Mr. Komoto's so sweet.

202
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:53,000
We knew this would be your very first offline meetup with everyone, Akane.

203
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:55,000
So we were all looking forward to this.

204
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:57,000
Nobody informed me. This is the worst.

205
00:10:58,000 --> 00:11:01,000
So, how'd you all meet? Have you known each other long?

206
00:11:01,000 --> 00:11:05,000
As fate would have it, us four met in a previous game we were playing.

207
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:08,000
We migrated over to FOSS when Eita introduced us to it.

208
00:11:08,000 --> 00:11:11,000
Runa here hardly ever logs in these days, though.

209
00:11:11,000 --> 00:11:12,000
We see her maybe once in three months.

210
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:16,000
I see. Aside from me, everyone at this meetup knows each other.

211
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:23,000
Eita was so excited about today, saying there was a lovely person joining us that he couldn't wait to welcome into our guild.

212
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:25,000
Hey, you're not going after my brother too, are you?

213
00:11:25,000 --> 00:11:26,000
Certainly not!

214
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:37,000
And here I thought you never lied. How's that phone call going, huh?

215
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:43,000
What's the matter?

216
00:11:43,000 --> 00:11:48,000
For some reason, I got the feeling she wanted me out of her sight immediately.

217
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:50,000
You stay away from me.

218
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:53,000
She was giving off that kind of aura.

219
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:56,000
Ah, so that's how you interpreted things, huh?

220
00:11:56,000 --> 00:12:00,000
I think it's safe to say what Runa said to her had upset her in a major way.

221
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:03,000
It seemed like Akanechi was just a little embarrassed to me.

222
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:05,000
Embarrassed about what?

223
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:06,000
Don't make me say it.

224
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:09,000
But I won't know what it is unless you say it.

225
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:12,000
Suppose that's the kind of guy you are.

226
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:13,000
Not that I mind, though.

227
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:17,000
Still, having seen Akanechi in real life, she sure is pretty, isn't she?

228
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:22,000
You told me she was just like her character, so I thought she'd be more childish.

229
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:23,000
Hmm?

230
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:27,000
Yamada! Yamada! Yamada!

231
