237
00:12:40,000 --> 00:12:44,000
My friend, you're never gonna find yourself a girlfriend with that kind of attitude.

238
00:12:44,000 --> 00:12:50,000
Isn't giving me a hard time about not having a girlfriend getting old?

239
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:53,000
I have to say, it used to be a fun past time.

240
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:55,000
But these days, I'm starting to get worried.

241
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:59,000
Your indifference towards girls is abnormal, you know?

242
00:12:59,000 --> 00:13:00,000
Hmm.

243
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:14,000
Did you feel sorry for me?

244
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:16,000
Did you feel sorry for me?

245
00:13:32,000 --> 00:13:33,000
