D destinies.

364
00:18:01,800 --> 00:18:11,260
Yamaru!

365
00:18:11,260 --> 00:18:13,820
Thanks for waiting for me.

366
00:18:20,320 --> 00:18:22,480
Are you doing okay there?

367
00:18:22,500 --> 00:18:23,240
I haven't.

368
00:18:23,660 --> 00:18:26,040
Or I'm like, my life depended on it since high school.

369
00:18:27,380 --> 00:18:29,020
What's with these big bags?

370
00:18:29,360 --> 00:18:30,200
What did you pack?

371
00:18:30,440 --> 00:18:31,920
Oh, this here's curry.

372
00:18:33,920 --> 00:18:36,040
I'm pretty sure you don't cook rice at home.

373
00:18:36,380 --> 00:18:38,080
So I brought some frozen rice too.

374
00:18:38,080 --> 00:18:41,000
I just made this curry earlier today.

375
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:42,920
So it should last for at least two days.

376
00:18:43,860 --> 00:18:47,320
Since I'm strapped for cash this month, there's not much meat in it.

377
00:18:47,660 --> 00:18:52,320
But to make up for that, I'll give you the salad and pickled veggies I just bought at the convenience store.

378
00:18:52,720 --> 00:18:54,160
No, that's not...

379
00:18:54,160 --> 00:18:56,100
I wouldn't feel right taking this.

380
00:18:56,300 --> 00:18:57,940
And you just said your money's tight, so...

381
00:18:57,940 --> 00:19:00,220
Trust me, you have to eat right or you won't grow properly.

382
00:19:00,620 --> 00:19:02,100
Sure, but I...

383
00:19:02,100 --> 00:19:03,360
Pudding is for dessert.

384
00:19:04,100 --> 00:19:06,320
Well, yeah, but still...

385
00:19:06,320 --> 00:19:08,380
Here, from one guildmate to another.

386
00:19:10,080 --> 00:19:10,640
But...

387
00:19:10,640 --> 00:19:14,180
