396
00:19:32,640 --> 00:19:33,680
Runa.

397
00:19:33,680 --> 00:19:38,780
Oh, hey, what's up?

398
00:19:38,780 --> 00:19:41,520
I got your number from my brother.

399
00:19:42,020 --> 00:19:43,660
Sorry I didn't ask you first.

400
00:19:43,940 --> 00:19:44,920
Oh, that's okay.

401
00:19:45,480 --> 00:19:47,560
I'm sorry for being so rude to you.

402
00:19:47,980 --> 00:19:50,060
I know you came all the way there to meet us.

403
00:19:50,060 --> 00:19:53,480
My brother told me to apologize, too.

404
00:19:53,600 --> 00:19:54,040
What?

405
00:19:54,400 --> 00:19:55,980
Don't worry, I don't mind one bit.

406
00:19:56,240 --> 00:19:59,080
Who doesn't get nervous when meeting people for the first time?

407
00:19:59,080 --> 00:20:04,460
Then, if you want, I'd like to hang out again.

408
00:20:04,460 --> 00:20:08,880
The next time, I want to do it right.

409
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:10,500
And get along with you.

410
00:20:10,500 --> 00:20:11,500
Runa?

411
00:20:11,500 --> 00:20:11,600
Runa?

412
00:20:14,540 --> 00:20:15,100
Okay.

413
00:20:16,240 --> 00:20:16,840
Sure.

414
00:20:18,340 --> 00:20:19,880
You said next Saturday, right?

415
00:20:20,340 --> 00:20:21,180
Yeah, sounds good.

416
00:20:22,040 --> 00:20:22,440
Great.

417
00:20:23,240 --> 00:20:24,800
I'm looking forward to it, too.

418
00:20:25,800 --> 00:20:26,260
Bye.

419
00:20:26,260 --> 00:20:29,560
I'm gonna hang out with Runa next weekend.

420
00:20:29,900 --> 00:20:30,800
Uh, right.

421
00:20:31,040 --> 00:20:31,600
I could hear.

422
00:20:32,500 --> 00:20:34,660
I thought she couldn't stand the sight of me.

423
00:20:35,020 --> 00:20:35,680
I'm thrilled.

424
00:20:36,680 --> 00:20:39,700
Now I'm getting super curious about what Runa's like in-game.

425
00:20:40,080 --> 00:20:40,840
Do you know Yamada?

426
00:20:41,160 --> 00:20:41,580
A little.

427
00:20:41,920 --> 00:20:43,820
What's her job class, and what does she use?

428
00:20:44,100 --> 00:20:45,060
Ooh, is she a mage?

429
00:20:45,420 --> 00:20:47,020
I would love to see her sometime.

430
00:20:47,400 --> 00:20:48,580
What level is she, I wonder?

431
00:20:51,120 --> 00:20:51,840
That's great.

432
00:20:52,380 --> 00:20:54,880
Yeah, I'm gonna add Runa's number to my contacts.

433
00:20:56,260 --> 00:21:09,420
She said Saturday, right?

434
00:21:12,480 --> 00:21:14,040
Runa Sasaki.

435
00:21:14,640 --> 00:21:15,420
Tutoring job.

436
00:21:16,840 --> 00:21:18,000
As I thought.

437
00:21:21,540 --> 00:21:22,220
Hmm.

438
00:21:23,180 --> 00:21:24,320
Did I hear her wrong?

439
00:22:56,000 --> 00:23:01,000
Today I'm going to show you all the avatars Tsurihima likes to use.

440
00:23:03,000 --> 00:23:06,000
First up, Alice's Flower Clock Set.

441
00:23:06,000 --> 00:23:10,000
It's a really popular avatar that I tend to wear every now and again.

442
00:23:10,000 --> 00:23:14,000
Next we have the Priest's Holy Robe Max.

443
00:23:14,000 --> 00:23:17,000
When I remove this avatar, my armor's on full display.

444
00:23:17,000 --> 00:23:21,000
Now behold, the Red Roses for the Queen Set.

445
00:23:21,000 --> 00:23:24,000
It's gorgeous, though I don't really wear it that often.

446
00:23:24,000 --> 00:23:27,000
Last but not least, my usual.

447
00:23:27,000 --> 00:23:30,000
It has the best stats and it's my favorite.

448
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:32,000
My heartfelt gratitude to you all for watching.

449
00:23:32,000 --> 00:23:37,000
If you enjoyed this display, look forward to more hot tips from Yurihima, so stay tuned.

450
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:39,000
Okay, me.

